# Open Font License & Typography Archive Distribution Notice

This repository is curated by Golam Rabbii as a comprehensive public typographic resource for educational, typing practice, research, and design purposes.

1. Open-Source Fonts (Google Fonts, Indian Type Foundry, EkType, Linux Indic Projects):
   Licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1 (OFL-1.1) or Apache License, Version 2.0.
   Full text of the SIL Open Font License is available at: http://scripts.sil.org/OFL

2. Government Standard Typefaces (C-DAC, SakalBharati, Mangal):
   Released for public utility, educational, and official Indian language computing purposes.

3. Legacy Typewriter & DTP Fonts (Kruti Dev, DevLys, Shree-Lipi, Chanakya):
   Provided under fair-use conventions for legacy document accessibility, typing examination practice, and traditional printing media compatibility. All respective trademarks and copyrights remain property of their original developers and foundries.
